Z||000007||Dave Gunsul||08-27-2001||09:07 PM||||There are a lot of aftermarket wheels that are lighter than that in a 16.<P>BBS RK: 16x7 = 15.5 IB's<P>Kosei K-1: 16x7.5 = 15.0-15.5 IB's<BR>(Note: i've currently got these on my GT only in a 15.)<P>SSR GT1: 16x7 = 15.0-15.5 IB's<P>SSR integral: 16x7 = 15.5 IB's<P>SSR Competition: 16x7 = 11.3-11.9 IB's<BR>(note: these are the wheels i'm thinking of<BR>switching to)<P>All these wheels and weights are from the Tire Rack and can be seen at: <A HREF="http://www.tirerack.com" TARGET=_blank>www.tirerack.com</A> <P>------------------<BR>Dave Gunsul<BR>N.I.F.E. member<BR>86 GT modified<BR>85 SE daily driver||||reg||1
